# The kit ref this repository runs. One line: a 40-character commit
# sha, or a v<semver> tag. NEVER a branch.
# ON origin/master, NOT kit's local HEAD: a pin to a commit that
# exists only on one laptop is a pin no other clone can fetch, and it
# turns `git clone anywaye/gateway` into a broken checkout.
# Move it with the stack diff in front of you: `bin/dev pin <ref>` is how,
# and it prints the stack diff between the two refs before it writes this
# file.
